    "description": "<p>Kura have charcoal-black, light-drinking scales and violet or blue bioluminescent eyes. Their houses inhabit deep valleys, eclipse-shrouded monasteries and ruins where decay must be contained rather than conquered.</p>\n<p>Kura are often feared as omens of death, but most see themselves as custodians of endings. They know that rot, silence and winter are necessary parts of every cycle.</p>\n<p>You gain Darkvision and a +1 racial bonus to all Stealth checks.</p>\n<p><em>Granted:</em> Darkvision as an ability item, and a +1 racial bonus to all Stealth checks.</p>",
